rem Special Subset Sums: Meta-testing
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=106
rem Count the subset pairs of an n-set
rem that still need an equality test.


use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Size integer = 12

rem For subsets of size k, choose 2k
rem items and split them into two
rem groups: half of C(2k, k) ways.
rem Splits that stay ordered element by
rem element, counted by the Catalan
rem number, are decided by size alone.
Half = Size // 2
K = 2 to Half array
Pairs = (K * 2) binomial K
Pool' = Size binomial (K * 2)
Catalan' = Pairs // (K + 1)
Open' = Pairs // 2 - Catalan
Answer = (Pool * Open) sum
Answer print
